    "created_at": "2016-04-29T20:00:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-29T20:00:32Z",
    "body": "I added a bunch of use counters in this general area:\n- [V8SVGStyleElement_Disabled_AttributeGetter](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/798)\n- [V8SVGStyleElement_Disabled_AttributeSetter](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/799)\n- [HTMLLinkElementDisabled](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/809)\n- [V8HTMLLinkElement_Disabled_AttributeGetter](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/810)\n- [V8HTMLLinkElement_Disabled_AttributeSetter](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/811)\n- [V8HTMLStyleElement_Disabled_AttributeGetter](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/812)\n- [V8HTMLStyleElement_Disabled_AttributeSetter](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/813)\n\nHTMLLinkElementDisabled is for when the disabled content attribute changes, the others are for IDL attribute getters and setters.\n",
