    "created_at": "2016-05-02T09:05:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-02T09:07:56Z",
    "body": "The difference between V8HTMLLinkElement_Disabled_AttributeSetter and HTMLLinkElementDisabled is something like 0.003 percent units.\n\nLooking in httparchive (472k pages) I see 130 resources (from 128 pages, so ~0.027% of total pages) containing `<link disabled>`, of which 126 have \"stylesheet\", 25 have \"alternate\". See results at https://gist.github.com/zcorpan/05b2a50c5c854d4b2eee62aa0418ca29\n",
